    {
      "q": "What does Treasury buy?",
      "a": "Treasury bought metals processing and information technology and services. Nonferrous Metal (except Aluminum) Smelting and Refining received $1.4B, Other Computer Related Services received $1B, and Computer Systems Design Services received $655M, among other top NAICS categories."
